{
  "name": "Frigid Explorer",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following benefits.</p><ul><li><strong>Frost Resistance.</strong> You have Resistance to Cold damage.</li><li><strong>Hunter's Rime.</strong> When you hit a creature with a weapon, you can deal an extra 1d6 Cold damage to the target, which can take this extra damage only once per turn. This extra damage ignores Resistance to Cold damage. When you reach Ranger level 11, this extra damage increases to 2d6.</li><li>A creature that took damage from this feature cannot use the Dash or Disengange Actions until the start of your next turn.</li></ul>",
